    <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Heritages and rentings management" id="id-1e45310668cb439da4a89632c3d92ca7">
      <documentation>Definition: The 'Heritages and Rentings Management' IT concept refers to the use of information technology tools and systems to manage, track, and control the renting and heritage properties. This includes tasks such as tenant management, rent tracking, property maintenance, and heritage property preservation.

Source: Techopedia

Source reference: https://www.techopedia.com/

Additional information: In the context of IT, 'Heritages and Rentings Management' involves the use of software applications to automate and streamline the processes involved in managing rental and heritage properties. This can include tasks such as tracking rent payments, managing tenant information, scheduling property maintenance, and ensuring the preservation of heritage properties. These systems can also include features such as online payment processing, digital lease signing, and tenant portals. They can be used by property management companies, real estate agencies, and individual landlords or property owners.

Example: Examples of 'Heritages and Rentings Management' IT applications include property management software like AppFolio, Buildium, or Rent Manager. These systems allow property managers to track rent payments, manage tenant information, and schedule maintenance. On the other hand, heritage management software like PastPerfect or Proficio can be used by museums, historical societies, and other organizations to manage and preserve heritage properties.

LOST view: OV-Digital Public Services Catalogue

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/HeritagesAndRentingsManagementBusinessService

EIRA traceability: eira:DigitalPublicBusinessService

ABB name: egovera:HeritagesAndRentingsManagementBusinessService

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-07-27

dct:identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/HeritagesAndRentingsManagementBusinessService

dct:title: Heritages and rentings management Digital Public Service

</documentation>
