as a central hub, integrating and harmonizing content across these systems, ensuring a seamless user experience and efficient data exchange.&#xA;&#xA;Overall, the application of Content Management within the context of IT interoperability in a digital public service at the European Commission enables efficient management of multilingual content, structured data, collaboration, and integration with other IT systems. This ensures the delivery of accurate and accessible information and services to citizens and stakeholders across Europe."/>
