nomalies, and identify potential security breaches or privacy violations. By monitoring and analyzing data access patterns, user behavior, and system logs, data analytics can help ensure the security and privacy of data exchanged between IT systems. This is particularly important in the context of digital public services, where sensitive citizen data is involved.&#xA;&#xA;Overall, data analytics plays a vital role in enhancing IT interoperability within digital public services in the European Commission. It helps in ensuring data quality, monitoring system performance, predicting issues, facilitating data mapping, and ensuring security and privacy."/>
