    <element xsi:type="archimate:Representation" name="JSON-LD" id="id-5045226442764b2aaf6136057ccc3fc7">
      <documentation>Description: JSON-LD (JSON for Linked Data) is a serialization format that enables the representation of linked data using JSON (JavaScript Object Notation). It allows for the integration of structured data from different sources on the web, facilitating interoperability and knowledge sharing across systems.

Publisher: W3C

Source: https://www.w3.org/TR/json-ld11/

LOST view: SV-Functional Architecture Principles

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/JSON-LDRepresentation

