    <element xsi:type="archimate:Representation" name="SPARQL" id="id-8ca280dc9364449788cde39ffbb8bd5e">
      <documentation>Description: SPARQL is a query language that enables organizations to extract valuable insights and knowledge from their semantic data. It plays a crucial role in the field of linked data and the semantic web, which focus on creating structured and interconnected data ecosystems.

Publisher: W3C

Source: https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!&amp;&amp;p=97d6e35279e66026JmltdHM9MTY4NzM5MjAwMCZpZ3VpZD0wMjYzNjViYy02Y2NlLTY1YzAtMDc1ZS03NzEwNmQ2NjY0NGYmaW5zaWQ9NTIwMA&amp;ptn=3&amp;hsh=3&amp;fclid=026365bc-6cce-65c0-075e-77106d66644f&amp;psq=sparwl*&amp;u=a1aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnL1RSL3NwYXJxbDExLXF1ZXJ5Lw&amp;ntb=1

LOST view: SV-Functional Architecture Principles

