    <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationComponent" name="Data Integration" id="id-1340f87c600e44c0821275d8f1367822">
      <documentation>Definition: Data Integration ABB is an Application Component that implements the process of combining data from different sources or systems into a unified view, ensuring consistency, accuracy, and accessibility. It involves transforming and merging data from various formats, structures, and locations to provide a comprehensive and integrated data set.

Source: Wikipedia

Source reference: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Data_integration

LOST view: Technical view - application

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/DataIntegrationApplicationComponent

EIRA traceability: eira:DigitalSolutionApplicationComponent

ABB name: egovera:DataIntegrationApplicationComponent

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-07-20

dct:identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/DataIntegrationApplicationComponent

dct:title: Data Integration Application Service

</documentation>
