    <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationService" name="Online restricted access to national tax database system" id="id-02acef1f0ccf40c8934bf9d8c10afb1d">
      <documentation>Definition: It represents the use or consumption of features provided by an online restricted access to national database system allowing Public Administration to restrict access to the national tax database.

Source: Self-generated

Source reference: N/A

Additional information: The 'Online restricted access to national tax database system' is a digital platform that allows authorized personnel, typically from Public Administration, to access and manage the national tax database. This system is designed with high-level security measures to ensure that sensitive tax information is protected and only accessible to those with the necessary permissions. It provides various features such as data retrieval, data update, data analysis, and report generation. The system is typically used to manage tax records, process tax payments, and conduct audits.

Example: 1. A tax officer uses the system to check a citizen's tax payment history. 2. An auditor uses the system to conduct a comprehensive audit of a company's tax records. 3. A government official uses the system to generate a report on national tax revenue.

LOST view: TVA-Tax Management Enablers [Motivation]

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/OnlineRestrictedAccessToNationalTaxDatabaseSystemApplicationService

EIRA traceability: eira:DigitalSolutionApplicationService

ABB name: egovera:OnlineRestrictedAccessToNationalTaxDatabaseSystemApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-07-28

dct:identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/OnlineRestrictedAccessToNationalTaxDatabaseSystemApplicationService

dct:title: Online Restricted Access To National Tax Database System Application Service

</documentation>
