      <property key="skos:note" value="The Import Control System 2 (ICS 2) is a significant upgrade from the previous system, aiming to enhance the security of goods entering the European Union. It mandates businesses importing goods into the EU to provide detailed advance cargo information to customs authorities. This information includes specifics about the goods, the importer, and the shipper. The system is designed to streamline the process of importing goods into the EU while ensuring a high level of security."/>
