    <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationService" name="Full base discovery" id="id-7831815aff68453ab9b6ea5f39eb016e">
      <documentation>Definition: Full base discovery represents the use or consumption of features provided by a full base discovery service. A full base discovery system is a business intelligence solution that applies discovery rules and recognition patterns to identify possible tax avoidances and frauds.

Source: OpenAI

Source reference: https://www.openai.com/

Additional information: Full base discovery is a comprehensive approach to business intelligence that uses advanced algorithms and pattern recognition to identify potential fraudulent activities or tax evasion. This system is designed to analyze large volumes of data, identify patterns, and flag suspicious activities for further investigation. It is an essential tool for businesses, financial institutions, and government agencies to ensure compliance with tax laws and regulations, and to prevent fraud. The system can be customized to suit the specific needs of an organization, and can be integrated with other business intelligence tools for a more holistic approach to data analysis and decision making.

Example: A financial institution uses a full base discovery system to analyze customer transactions and identify suspicious patterns that may indicate money laundering or tax evasion.
A government agency uses full base discovery to analyze tax return data and identify potential cases of tax fraud.
A retail company uses full base discovery to analyze sales data and identify potential cases of employee theft or fraud.

LOST view: TVA-Tax Management Enablers [Motivation]

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/FullBaseDiscoveryApplicationService

EIRA traceability: eira:DigitalSolutionApplicationService

ABB name: egovera:FullBaseDiscoveryApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-07-28

dct:identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/FullBaseDiscoveryApplicationService

dct:title: Full Base Discovery Application Service

</documentation>
