    <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationService" name="eIDAS-Node" id="id-9b5f006033224b8c8656005c34b2ae4f">
      <documentation>Description: The eIDAS-Node software is a sample implementation of the eID eIDAS Profile. It was developed by the European Commission with the help of Member States collaborating in the technical sub-committee of the eIDAS Expert Group. The eIDAS-Node software contains the necessary modules to help Member States to communicate with other eIDAS-compliant counterparts in a centralised or distributed fashion.

Publisher: European Commission

Source: https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/display/DIGITAL/eIDAS-Node+version+2.6

