    <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationService" name="Tax virtual assistant service" id="id-b80069f4c2ad4c478bd200578dc0df8b">
      <documentation>Definition: Tax Virtual Assistant Service refers to the utilization of features provided by a virtual assistance service that enables the use of virtual assistants to provide professional administrative, technical, or creative (social) assistance to customers remotely from a home office. These services are specifically tailored to handle tax-related tasks and queries.

Source: OpenAI

Source reference: https://www.openai.com/

Additional information: Tax Virtual Assistant Service is a modern approach to handling tax-related tasks and queries. It leverages the power of artificial intelligence to provide remote assistance to customers. These virtual assistants are programmed to handle a wide range of tasks including but not limited to tax preparation, tax advice, tax filing, and tax planning. They are capable of performing these tasks with high accuracy and efficiency, thus saving time and resources for both businesses and individuals. The use of such services is becoming increasingly popular due to the convenience and flexibility they offer. Customers can access these services from the comfort of their homes or offices, at any time of the day.

Example: 1. An individual uses a Tax Virtual Assistant Service to get assistance with their tax preparation. The virtual assistant helps them gather all the necessary documents, fill out the tax forms, and file them with the tax authorities.
2. A small business owner uses a Tax Virtual Assistant Service to get advice on tax planning. The virtual assistant provides them with strategies to minimize their tax liability and maximize their tax savings.
3. A large corporation uses a Tax Virtual Assistant Service to handle all their tax-related tasks. The virtual assistant takes care of everything from tax preparation to tax filing, allowing the corporation to focus on their core business activities.

LOST view: TVA-Tax Management Enablers [Motivation]

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/TaxVirtualAssistantServiceApplicationService

EIRA traceability: eira:DigitalSolutionApplicationService

ABB name: egovera:TaxVirtualAssistantServiceApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-07-28

dct:identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/TaxVirtualAssistantServiceApplicationService

dct:title: Tax Virtual Assistant Service Application Service

</documentation>
