    <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationService" name="Dataspace Connector" id="id-d23314e941c246e08171cfb057083b43">
      <documentation>Definition: Dataspace Connector ABB is an Application Service that enables the easy and trustworthy procedure to share data and work collaboratively with other research institutions.

Source: IDSA

