eira:iopDimension: Structural IoP

LOST view: TVA-Data Space Enablers [Motivation]

eira:iopSaliency: The Dataspace Connector Application Service ABB is salient for technical interoperability because it provides the way or method, the procedure for different parties (public services, public organisations, etc) to exchange data in a collaborative method. 

