    <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationService" name="eTranslation" id="id-e0fb9113808849bfa721b6958ccbabc1">
      <documentation>Description: eTranslation is a state-of-the-art neural machine translation service offered by the European Commission. It enables users to automatically translate text and documents between multiple languages with high accuracy and speed.

Additional information: The eTranslation digital service utilizes advanced neural machine translation technology to provide efficient and reliable translation capabilities. It supports translation between 27 European languages, as well as numerous non-European languages. The service is designed to cater to various needs, including individuals, businesses, public administrations, and organizations. It offers a user-friendly web interface and a robust API for seamless integration into different applications and workflows. eTranslation ensures data privacy and security, as all translations are processed securely within the European Union. The service continuously improves its translation quality through machine learning techniques and user feedback. It plays a crucial role in promoting multilingualism, facilitating cross-border communication, and fostering digital transformation across Europe.

Example: eTranslation can be used by a business to translate product descriptions, customer reviews, and marketing materials to target international markets. It can assist a public administration in translating official documents, regulations, and public communications to ensure accessibility and inclusivity. Additionally, it can aid individuals in translating personal documents, emails, or websites to overcome language barriers and enhance communication in a globalized world.

Publisher: European Commission

Source: https://ec.europa.eu/info/research-and-innovation/research-area/digital-transformation_en

LOST view: TVA-Translation Enablers [Motivation]

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/ETranslationApplicationService

EIRA traceability: eira:MachineTranslationApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:SolutionBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-07-25

dct:identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/ETranslationApplicationService

dct:title: eTranslation Application Service

</documentation>
