    <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationService" name="Tax information portal service" id="id-e1410cb457ee42f1852740be0f5b1903">
      <documentation>Description: A Tax Information Portal Service is a platform that facilitates the use or consumption of features enabling the search and discovery of tax information from diverse sources. These sources can include emails, online forums, and search engines, all presented in a uniform way.

Additional information: A Tax Information Portal Service is a comprehensive tool designed to simplify the process of finding and understanding tax-related information. It integrates data from various sources, including emails, online forums, and search engines, and presents it in a user-friendly, uniform manner. This service can be particularly useful for individuals and businesses seeking to navigate the complexities of tax laws and regulations. It can provide information on a wide range of tax-related topics, from basic tax concepts to specific tax codes and regulations. The service may also include features such as tax calculators, tax form finders, and links to relevant tax agencies and resources.

Example: 1. An individual uses a Tax Information Portal Service to find information on how to file their personal income tax return.
2. A small business owner uses a Tax Information Portal Service to understand the specific tax regulations that apply to their industry.
3. A tax professional uses a Tax Information Portal Service to stay updated on the latest changes in tax laws and regulations.

Publisher: Assistant's Knowledge

Source: N/A

LOST view: TVA-Tax Management Enablers [Motivation]

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/TaxInformationPortalServiceApplicationService

EIRA traceability: eira:DigitalSolutionApplicationService

ABB name: egovera:TaxInformationPortalServiceApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:SolutionBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-07-28

dct:identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/TaxInformationPortalServiceApplicationService

dct:title: Tax Information Portal Service Application Service

</documentation>
