    <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationService" name="eFiles Management" id="id-f668ece175f042f7ab635978e4a063d4">
      <documentation>LOST view: TVA-Functional Architecture Principles

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/EFilesManagementApplicationService

EIRA traceability: eira:DigitalSolutionApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

