    <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Eurostat Data Catalogue" id="id-093d12f925bf48e39c6099ab899f18ea">
      <documentation>Description: The EUROSTAT data catalogue is a comprehensive repository of statistical data and indicators maintained by EUROSTAT, the statistical office of the European Union (EU). It serves as a central platform for accessing a wide range of statistical information about the EU and its member states. The catalogue provides a structured and organized collection of datasets covering various domains such as economy, population, employment, agriculture, trade, and many others.

Publisher: Eurostat

Source: https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/main/home

