    <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="JRC Data Catalogue" id="id-18d018a67e2341deb919d14f4c30aab7">
      <documentation>Description: The Joint Research Center (JRC) Data Catalogue is a collection of metadata records that provides information about datasets produced by the Joint Research Centre (JRC) in accordance with its Data Policy. The JRC, as the European Commission's in-house science service, conducts research to provide independent scientific advice and support to the policies of the European Union.

Publisher: Joint Research Center (JRC)

