    <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="ESCO" id="id-80419569ccc2442f9e18fce645a48de5">
      <documentation>Description: The ESCO classification identifies and categorises skills, competences, and occupations relevant for the EU labour market and education and training. It systematically shows the relationships between the different concepts.

