      <property key="skos:note" value="The Tax Base Amounts Registry is a critical component in the tax administration system. It includes all the taxable income, property, sales, and other taxable entities. The registry is updated regularly to reflect the current financial status of taxpayers. It is used by tax authorities to calculate the tax liabilities of individuals and businesses. The registry helps in ensuring tax compliance and preventing tax evasion. It also aids in the formulation of tax policies and strategies. The data in the registry is confidential and is protected by privacy laws."/>
