      <property key="skos:note" value="CCN is a critical component in modern digital communication, enabling different systems and devices to communicate effectively. It provides a common platform for data transmission, ensuring that all systems can understand and interpret the data being sent. CCN can be used in various settings, including local area networks (LANs), wide area networks (WANs), and even the internet. It is designed to handle different types of data, including text, images, audio, and video, making it a versatile solution for many different applications."/>
