    <element xsi:type="archimate:Requirement" name="Directive (EU) 2022/2555 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 14 December 2022" id="id-bf830806bb5249de8a36237852e6aff2">
      <documentation>Description: Directive (EU) 2022/2555, also known as the NIS2 Directive, is the EU-wide legislation on cybersecurity. It provides legal measures to boost the overall level of cybersecurity in the EU.

