      <property key="dct:modified" value="2024-01-28"/>
      <property key="skos:definition" value="Shared Knowledge Content ABB is a Grouping setting semantic (re)usable resources, with convergence power, in relation to public policy goals attainment, enabling common understanding from existing information across public administrations, and borders. "/>
