              <child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-c4cb028505d044eaba717db411492acf" targetConnections="id-bac32f348f7641f2b7c758afc2ebef13" font="1|Segoe UI|9.0|3|WINDOWS|1|0|0|0|0|700|1|0|0|1|0|0|0|0|Segoe UI" textPosition="1" archimateElement="id-5045226d0e734e6ca78ef661bfecf349" type="1">
