      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-deac68a2ea924579a64e8c4c3c654087" font="1|Segoe UI|15.75|0|WINDOWS|1|-21|0|0|0|0|0|0|0|0|3|2|1|34|Segoe UI" textAlignment="1">
        <bounds x="2145" y="72" width="672" height="180"/>
        <content>To discuss: Infrastructure services, nodes, facilities, etc... are quite abstract and each one can use different mechanism. Maybe GAIA-X or other elements can be reused, but most of the elements (IMHO) will be included as ABBs directly from EIRA. </content>
